<p>You rend the very essence of the target, drawing on their life and converting it to void stars. The target takes <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">99, 133, 159, 182, 202</acronym> darkness and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">99, 133, 159, 182, 202</acronym> temporal damage, and you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> void star(s).</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>